<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not well tested on a live basis, compared with Tuesday's close, according to USDA.</p>
<p>On a carcass basis, steers and heifers not well tested.</p>
<p>Steers:   Select and Choice 2-4 1200-1250 lbs few 110.00</p>
<p>Heifers:  Select and Choice 2-4 1050-1150 lbs few 110.00</p>
<p>Reported sales for Thurs: 500.   Week to Date: 4,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
